  fade: {fileID: 1975992989}
  fadeHoldAtStart: 12
  fadeInAtStart: 6
  fadeOutBeforeHandoff: 0.5
  fadeInAfterHandoff: 0.6
  titleText: {fileID: 285062029}
  timeText: {fileID: 932477095}
  titleIn: 16.5
  timeIn: 19.3
  textOut: 52.4
  subtitleText: {fileID: 1019656760}
  subtitles:
  - start: 3.6699982
    end: 5.2999983
    text: Uzun zaman oldu.
  - start: 5.9300003
    end: 9.302994
    text: "\xDC\xE7 y\u0131l. Sayd\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 bilmiyordum."
  - start: 9.529999
    end: 12.439999
    text: "Sayd\u0131m. Her g\xFCn\xFCn\xFC."
  - start: 12.580002
    end: 17.33
    text: "Komik. Ben de sayd\u0131m. Ar\u015Fiv odas\u0131nda."
  - start: 17.38
    end: 17.93
    text: "Wayne\u2014"
  - start: 17.98
    end: 23.28
    text: "O odada durup karar\u0131n benim oldu\u011Funu s\xF6yledin.\nBenim karar\u0131m,
      Richard."
  - start: 23.33
    end: 26.74
    text: "Bir ailem vard\u0131. \u0130kimizi birden g\xF6merlerdi."
  - start: 26.98
    end: 29.352993
    text: "Sen de beni g\xF6md\xFCn."
  - start: 30.98
    end: 36
    text: "Buras\u0131 tart\u0131\u015Fman\u0131n ne yeri ne zaman\u0131, Wayne.\n\xC7iftli\u011Fe
      vard\u0131n m\u0131?"
  - start: 36.05
    end: 38.65
    text: Peki.
  - start: 38.7
    end: 40.55
    text: "Tabelay\u0131 yeni ge\xE7tim."
  - start: 40.6
    end: 46.7
    text: "K\xF6yl\xFCler o \xE7iftlik evinden sesler duyuyormu\u015F. \xC7o\u011Funlukla
      geceleri.\nEv y\u0131llard\u0131r bo\u015F."
  - start: 46.75
    end: 51.9
    text: "Eski Miller evi. Aile '89'da gitti.\nO g\xFCnden beri kimse dokunmad\u0131."
  - start: 51.95
    end: 52.922993
    text: ...Miller.
  - start: 53.3
    end: 55.8
    text: "Ve akl\u0131na ben geldim. Ne incelik."
  - start: 55.85
    end: 61
    text: "Gelmedin. \u0130hbar senin ad\u0131nla geldi. Seni istediler."
  - start: 67.4
    end: 69.482994
    text: "\"I\u015F\u0131klar s\xF6nmeden gel.\""
  - start: 72.9
    end: 80.299995
    text: "Richard. Onca y\u0131l\u0131n hatr\u0131na... beni nas\u0131l bir konumda
      b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131\nbir kenara b\u0131rak ve bana do\u011Fruyu
      s\xF6yle."
  - start: 80.35
    end: 83.22299
    text: Beni kim istedi? Ve neden?
  - start: 84.55
    end: 88.45
    text: "Tek bildi\u011Fim, eski dostum, bu i\u015Fi sana vermeleri."
  - start: 88.5
    end: 92.95
    text: "\u0130\u015Fin bitince beni mutlaka ara. Karakolu de\u011Fil. Beni."
  - start: 93
    end: 95.103
    text: "T\u0131pk\u0131 eski g\xFCnlerdeki gibi."
  duckSources:
